WEBVTT

00:05:28.314 --> 00:05:31.031
she's ready to show off
her portal-punching skills,

00:05:31.055 --> 00:05:32.056
(Laughter)

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.992
and I stripped that safety net
from her right away.

00:05:35.502 --> 00:05:38.644
And I limited her powers,
and I changed up her location

00:05:38.668 --> 00:05:43.244
and shook up her world,
because that is what college is like,

00:05:43.268 --> 00:05:44.269
(Laughter)

00:05:44.293 --> 00:05:45.923
especially if you're alone.

00:05:47.602 --> 00:05:50.241
But I didn't want America
to be alone for long,

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:54.513
and so in a homework assignment
gone totally wrong,

00:05:54.537 --> 00:05:57.187
she lands on a battlefield with the X-Men.

00:05:57.664 --> 00:05:58.703
(Laughter)

00:05:58.727 --> 00:06:00.830
Because, when I was in college,